{"id":"n52152-1-4","stage":5,"title":"똑똑 · 叭哒叭哒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52152-1-4-1","ko":"천장에서 물이 똑똑 떨어져.","zh":"天花板上正在滴水呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"천장에서","meaning":"顶棚，天棚","explanation":"천장：顶棚，天棚；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"천장","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24944","senseId":"1","lemma":"천장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"똑똑","meaning":"叭哒叭哒，滴答滴答","explanation":"똑똑：叭哒叭哒，滴答滴答","readings":[{"term":"똑똑","audio":"/audio/94fad08c23c0b0f4560f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52152","senseId":"1","lemma":"똑똑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어져.","meaning":"掉，下降","explanation":"떨어지다：掉，下降；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c80d260f8de85a6e","term":"천장","zh":"顶棚，天棚","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3","entryId":"24944","definition":"一座建筑物的室内顶部。","pronunciation":["천장"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"94fad08c23c0b0f4","term":"똑똑","zh":"叭哒叭哒，滴答滴答","audio":"/audio/94fad08c23c0b0f4560f.mp3","entryId":"52152","definition":"小物体或水滴一直掉落的声音；或指其模样。","pronunciation":["똑똑"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"掉，下降","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"由上往下落。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4301dc2dda221c92e6a3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52152-1-4-2","ko":"어머, 천장에서 물이 새나 보다.","zh":"哎呀，看来天花板上漏水了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"천장에서","meaning":"顶棚，天棚","explanation":"천장：顶棚，天棚；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"천장","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24944","senseId":"1","lemma":"천장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새나","meaning":"漏","explanation":"새다：漏；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"새다","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16231","senseId":"1","lemma":"새다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보다.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"c80d260f8de85a6e","term":"천장","zh":"顶棚，天棚","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3","entryId":"24944","definition":"一座建筑物的室内顶部。","pronunciation":["천장"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"d152606bd862b709","term":"새다","zh":"漏","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3","entryId":"16231","definition":"气体或液体从缝或洞里泄出去。","pronunciation":["새다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）"